# Prettier is here to fill Biome's gaps, and the gaps are Markdown and YAML.
# Everything else Prettier can parse, Biome already owns - one tool with an
# opinion per file type, or the two of them fight over the same characters.
# The invocation only ever passes it *.md and *.yml/*.yaml globs; this file is
# the belt to that pair of braces, and the place to put anything those globs
# would otherwise sweep up.

node_modules
_site
.astro
.lighthouseci

